oomol/oo-mistral-ai  1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Provides OOMOL-connected access to Mistral AI through the `oo` CLI without exposing raw API tokens. - Supports chat, agent, FIM, embedding, moderation, OCR, and audio transcription workflows. - Manages Mistral Agents, agent versions, aliases, conversations, files, libraries, and library documents. - Includes read/list actions for models, files, batch jobs, fine-tuning jobs, conversations, and library resources. - Marks write and destructive actions clearly, with guidance to inspect live schema

